<title>NETHERLANDS: Hes to make one-for-one rights issue.</title>
<headline>Hes to make one-for-one rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and storage group Hes Beheer said on Wednesday it planned a one-for-one rights issue of 3.33 million share certificates at 12.50 guilders each, which would raise a total amount of 41.6 million guilders.  </p>
<p>Hes said the solvency of the group would increase substantially as a result of the rights issue and payments it was making out of its cash flow.</p>
<p>The group's solvency rate was expected to increase to 35 percent at the end of 1997 from 13.8 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
